{"t":"CTAS","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Cintas Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","employees":48100,"hq":"Cincinnati, OH, United States","website":"https://www.cintas.com","summary_en":"Cintas Corporation provides corporate identity uniforms and other garments in the United States, Canada, and Latin America. It operates through Uniform Rental and Facility Services, First Aid and Safety Services, and All Other segments. The company offers rental and servicing of uniforms and other garments, including flame resistant clothing, mats, mops and shop towels, and other ancillary items. It also provides restroom cleaning services and supplies; and sells uniforms from catalogs. In addition, the company offers first aid and safety products and services; workplace water services; and fire protection products and services. Further, it provides automated external defibrillators; eye-wash stations; safety training; fire extinguishers; sprinkler systems; and alarm services. The company sells its products and services through its distribution network and local delivery routes, or local representatives to small service and manufacturing companies, as well as major corporations. It serves gaming, hospitality, healthcare, automotive, government, education, pharmaceutical, manufacturing, skilled trades, and food processing industries. The company was founded in 1929 and is based in Cincinnati, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Cintas Corporation은 미국, 캐나다 및 라틴 아메리카에서 기업 아이덴티티 유니폼 및 기타 의류를 제공합니다. 유니폼 임대 및 시설 서비스, 응급 처치 및 안전 서비스 및 기타 모든 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 방염 의류, 매트, 대걸레, 작업용 타월, 기타 보조 품목을 포함하여 유니폼과 기타 의류의 대여 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 화장실 청소 서비스와 용품도 제공합니다. 카탈로그에서 유니폼을 판매합니다. 또한 회사는 응급처치 및 안전 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 직장 물 서비스; 화재 예방 제품 및 서비스. 또한 자동 외부 제세동기를 제공합니다. 눈 세척 스테이션; 안전교육; 소화기; 스프링클러 시스템; 그리고 알람 서비스. 회사는 유통망과 현지 배송 경로 또는 현지 대리점을 통해 소규모 서비스 및 제조 회사는 물론 대기업에 제품과 서비스를 판매합니다. 게임, 숙박업, 의료, 자동차, 정부, 교육, 제약, 제조, 숙련된 무역 및 식품 가공 산업에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1929년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 신시내티에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":223.16,"mcap":88611282944.0,"pe":44.015778,"fpe":36.221626,"peg":3.4853,"ps":7.6649246,"pb":17.130575,"ev_ebitda":29.194,"div":0.94,"beta":0.857,"hi52":233.46,"lo52":161.16},"fin":{"rev":11560620032.0,"rev_g":0.109,"eps_g":0.133,"gross":0.50990003,"op":0.24098,"net":0.17824,"roe":0.41375,"fcf":1743985280.0,"cash":364579008.0,"debt":2711374080.0,"de":52.096,"eps":5.07,"feps":6.16096},"own":{"short":0.038,"inst":0.70162004,"insider":0.1455},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":218.4375,"median":224.5,"high":250.0,"low":181.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.2,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-09-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Sell","FromGrade":"Sell","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":181.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-29","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":240.0,"priorPriceTarget":230.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-24","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":235.0,"priorPriceTarget":230.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-24","Firm":"Baird","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":222.0,"priorPriceTarget":214.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-24","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTarget":225.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-24","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":206.0,"priorPriceTarget":206.0},{"GradeDate":"202